EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}The other day a small child called
me "mom."{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}} I was surprised, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}but hey,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
at least she didn't say "grandma"!
